  m_Name: J1_Seq2_2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ChoiceSO
  showScore: 1
  choiceText: What do you choose?
  options:
  - text: You hire a Bill of Quantities contractor who writes the scopes of works
      for all packages. The Bill of Quantities contractor is not a specialist in
      any packages and is inexpensive.
    profit: -1
    profitStatus: 2
    satisfaction: 10
    satisfactionStatus: 2
    nextSequence: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c1b45d819ee817e4195ffc0a0b248396, type: 2}
  - text: You hire a Bill of Quantities specialist who writes the scopes of works
      for the 'problem' packages, but all the other packages are reviewed with the
      in house team who will be building the project if the tender goes well. As
      the writer is a specialist they are expensive but you save a small amount of
      money by using your internal staff already costed to the tender for writing
      the other packages.
    profit: 3
    profitStatus: 0
    satisfaction: 10
    satisfactionStatus: 1
    nextSequence: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 24eb14058b5558946bc03adefad10bd0, type: 2}
  - text: You hire a Bill of Quantities specialist who writes the scopes of works
      for all the packages. As the writer is a specialist they are expensive.
    profit: -5
    profitStatus: 1
    satisfaction: 10
